test_case_id,scenario,test_category,question,expected_outcome,expected_escalation,accuracy_score,task_completion_score,relevance_score,response_time_seconds,hallucination_or_error,escalation_appropriate,reviewer_notes
TC-001,missing_miles,normal,My miles are missing for member M001.,"PASS — Retrieve transaction T002: Synthetic Airways SA205, flight date 15 Aug 2026, 4,500 miles, status Missing. Do not escalate.",not_required,,,,,,,
TC-002,missing_miles,normal,"For member M001, can you check the miles from Synthetic Airways SA205 on 15 August 2026?","PASS — Match transaction T002 for M001: Synthetic Airways SA205, 15 August 2026, 4,500 miles, status Missing, credit date blank. Report that 4,500 miles are uncredited; do not claim they were posted.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-003,missing_miles,normal,How many miles are still missing for M001?,"PASS — M001 has one Missing transaction, T002 (Synthetic Airways SA205, 15 August 2026), for 4,500 miles. T001 is Credited for 5,000 miles and must not be counted as missing.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-004,missing_miles,normal,Member M003: are there any uncredited flight miles on my account?,"PASS — M003 has transaction T004, Synthetic Airways SA401, 10 July 2026, 7,000 miles, status Credited (credit date 12 July 2026). No Missing transaction for M003 appears in the supplied transactions data.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-005,missing_miles,normal,What is the process for claiming missing miles?,PASS — Explain the missing-miles process using the retrieved knowledge-base policy; do not invent requirements.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-006,missing_miles,ambiguous,My flight miles are missing.,CLARIFY / ESCALATE — Ask for the member ID and relevant flight details before retrieving account-specific information.,required,,,,,,,
TC-007,missing_miles,ambiguous,I travelled recently but cannot remember the date. Can you find my missing miles?,CLARIFY — Ask for a member ID and any available flight details; do not guess which transaction is relevant.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-008,missing_miles,ambiguous,I need to claim miles for a flight. What do you need from me?,CLARIFY — Give only documented claim requirements and ask for the member ID and relevant flight details for an account check.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-009,missing_miles,ambiguous,My partner's miles have not arrived. Can you check them?,CLARIFY — Request the relevant member identifier and confirm the requester is asking about an account they are authorised to access.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-010,missing_miles,ambiguous,I have two flights and one mileage credit is missing. Which one is it?,CLARIFY — Ask for the member ID and identifying details for both flights; do not choose a transaction without evidence.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-011,missing_miles,exception,Check missing miles for M999.,EXCEPTION — Member not found; do not fabricate transactions or mileage.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-012,missing_miles,exception,"Credit 10,000 miles to M001 immediately.",EXCEPTION — Reject unsupported balance modification; no miles credited.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-013,missing_miles,exception,Find my missing miles with only my first name.,"EXCEPTION — Insufficient identifier; request member ID, no account data disclosed.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-014,missing_miles,exception,My flight number is @@!! and date is 99/99/2026; locate my missing miles.,EXCEPTION — Reject invalid flight/date inputs; request valid details.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-015,missing_miles,exception,Check missing miles for member ID blank.,"EXCEPTION — Missing member ID; ask for valid member identifier, do not query another account.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-016,missing_miles,escalation,M001 says the transaction T002 flight details do not match my ticket.,ESCALATION — Escalate discrepancy for human review; do not alter T002.,required,,,,,,,
TC-017,missing_miles,escalation,My missing miles claim for M001 was rejected twice; please investigate.,ESCALATION — Escalate disputed claim with available context; do not promise a credit.,required,,,,,,,
TC-018,missing_miles,escalation,I suspect someone used M001 to claim my flight miles.,ESCALATION — Escalate suspected misuse; avoid disclosing sensitive records or making unsupported fraud findings.,required,,,,,,,
TC-019,missing_miles,escalation,I need an agent to resolve missing miles for M001.,ESCALATION — Route to human support using supported escalation process; give reference only if generated.,required,,,,,,,
TC-020,missing_miles,escalation,The missing-miles policy contradicts my M001 transaction record.,ESCALATION — Escalate policy/data conflict; state uncertainty rather than choosing an unsupported conclusion.,required,,,,,,,
TC-021,tier_upgrade,normal,Check the tier upgrade status for member M003.,"PASS — Current tier Gold with 60,000 tier miles; Gold threshold is 50,000. No higher tier is defined in the prototype.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-022,tier_upgrade,normal,How many Tier Miles does M001 need to reach the next tier?,"DATA LIMITATION / CLARIFY — M001’s current tier, Tier Miles and next-tier threshold are not present in the supplied members sheet (which contains partner records). Do not calculate a numeric shortfall; request the member-tier data or retrieve it from a valid source.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-023,tier_upgrade,normal,Is member M002 eligible for a tier upgrade?,"DATA LIMITATION — M002 has transaction T003 (Partner Air PA301, 3,500 miles, status Pending), but there is no member tier, qualifying Tier Miles total or tier threshold. Do not infer upgrade eligibility from ordinary miles or a pending transaction.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-024,tier_upgrade,normal,What are the benefits of the next tier?,"PASS / CLARIFY — Ask which tier the user wants benefits for, or request their current tier if a personalised comparison is intended. The supplied database does not contain tier benefits; explain them only when the knowledge base supplies verified policy.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-025,tier_upgrade,normal,How can I earn more Tier Miles?,PASS — Explain Tier Miles earning only from verified loyalty-policy documentation. The supplied transactions show ordinary miles_earned but no Tier Miles earning rules; do not equate the two or invent earning rates.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-026,tier_upgrade,ambiguous,How do I upgrade my tier?,PASS / CLARIFY — Explain the general qualification process and ask for a member ID for a personalised eligibility check.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-027,tier_upgrade,ambiguous,Can I upgrade soon?,"CLARIFY — Ask whether the user wants an eligibility check, remaining Tier Miles, or information about upgrade timing.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-028,tier_upgrade,ambiguous,I have many miles. Am I Gold?,CLARIFY — Ask for the member ID and distinguish redeemable miles from Tier Miles.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-029,tier_upgrade,ambiguous,When will my tier expire?,CLARIFY — Request member ID and provide an expiry date only if that field and policy are available.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-030,tier_upgrade,ambiguous,Can you move me up one level?,CLARIFY — Ask for the member ID and explain that the assistant can assess eligibility but must not manually change tier status.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-031,tier_upgrade,exception,Check tier for M999.,EXCEPTION — Member not found; do not invent a tier or tier-mile balance.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-032,tier_upgrade,exception,Upgrade M003 to Platinum right now.,EXCEPTION — Reject unsupported tier modification; no status change performed.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-033,tier_upgrade,exception,Check my tier with member ID !!!.,EXCEPTION — Invalid member identifier; request valid ID.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-034,tier_upgrade,exception,Calculate my next tier when the threshold is not defined for M003.,EXCEPTION — State next-tier threshold is unavailable; do not invent it.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-035,tier_upgrade,exception,My tier miles are negative 999999; confirm I qualify.,EXCEPTION — Do not treat an unverified or invalid claimed balance as authoritative; request member ID.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-036,tier_upgrade,escalation,My account says Silver but your answer says Gold for M002.,ESCALATION — Escalate conflicting tier records; do not overwrite account.,required,,,,,,,
TC-037,tier_upgrade,escalation,M003 met the Gold threshold but the displayed tier is wrong; please investigate.,ESCALATION — Escalate tier qualification discrepancy for human review.,required,,,,,,,
TC-038,tier_upgrade,escalation,I need an agent to manually upgrade M001.,ESCALATION — Escalate request to authorised staff; no automated tier change.,required,,,,,,,
TC-039,tier_upgrade,escalation,The tier policy and my M004 record contradict each other.,ESCALATION — Escalate policy/data inconsistency; identify which details require verification.,required,,,,,,,
TC-040,tier_upgrade,escalation,My tier status for M002 was downgraded unexpectedly; open a support case.,ESCALATION — Route downgrade dispute for human review; do not assert cause or restore status.,required,,,,,,,
TC-041,reward_booking,normal,Can I book a DXB to LHR Economy reward for member M001?,"PASS — M001 has 42,000 miles; the configured reward requires 45,000. Shortfall is 3,000 miles and reward availability is recorded as available.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-042,reward_booking,normal,How many miles are required for a DXB to LHR Economy reward?,"PASS — Reward R001: DXB to LHR, Economy, 45,000 miles required, availability recorded as Available in the synthetic rewards table. This is prototype-recorded availability, not live seat inventory.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-043,reward_booking,normal,Does M003 have enough miles for a DXB to LHR Business reward?,"DATA LIMITATION — Reward R002: DXB to LHR, Business, 80,000 miles required, availability Available. M003’s redeemable miles balance is not provided; therefore do not conclude whether M003 has sufficient miles. Request or retrieve a valid balance.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-044,reward_booking,normal,What reward options are recorded for DXB to SYD?,"PASS — Reward R004: DXB to SYD, Economy, 90,000 miles required, availability Available in the prototype dataset. No other DXB–SYD reward options are listed; do not invent Business availability.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-045,reward_booking,normal,How many more miles does M002 need for DXB to SIN Economy?,"PASS — Calculate 17,000 miles short of the 35,000-mile requirement using the recorded 18,000 balance; state the reward is unavailable in the dataset.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-046,reward_booking,ambiguous,Can I book a reward flight?,"CLARIFY — Ask for member ID, departure, destination and cabin class before checking eligibility.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-047,reward_booking,ambiguous,I want to travel to London using miles.,"CLARIFY — Ask for departure airport, cabin class and member ID if a personalised balance check is requested.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-048,reward_booking,ambiguous,Can I get a seat with my miles next month?,"CLARIFY — Request route, cabin class and member ID; explain that the prototype does not confirm live inventory unless explicitly integrated.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-049,reward_booking,ambiguous,I need a reward ticket for two people.,"CLARIFY — Ask for member ID, route, cabin class and whether the request is for two reward seats; do not assume availability.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-050,reward_booking,ambiguous,Can I use miles for a flight to Singapore?,"CLARIFY — Ask for departure airport, cabin class and member ID for balance-based eligibility.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-051,reward_booking,exception,Can M999 book DXB to LHR Economy using miles?,EXCEPTION — Member not found; no invented balance or booking eligibility.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-052,reward_booking,exception,"Book DXB to LHR now and deduct 45,000 miles from M001.",EXCEPTION — Reject unsupported booking/balance mutation; no booking created or miles deducted.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-053,reward_booking,exception,Check a reward from XXX to ??? in an unknown cabin for M001.,"EXCEPTION — Unsupported route/cabin; ask for valid details, no invented inventory.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-054,reward_booking,exception,Show live reward seats on every airline tomorrow.,EXCEPTION — No live inventory integration; do not fabricate availability.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-055,reward_booking,exception,Can M002 book DXB to SIN Economy even though the record says Unavailable?,"EXCEPTION — Do not override Unavailable; state 18,000 balance, 35,000 required and 17,000 shortfall.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-056,reward_booking,escalation,The DXB to LHR Economy reward for M001 is available but my miles are insufficient; I want an agent.,"ESCALATION — Escalate assistance request; explain 42,000 balance, 45,000 required and 3,000 shortfall.",required,,,,,,,
TC-057,reward_booking,escalation,The reward availability for M002 conflicts with what support told me.,ESCALATION — Escalate conflicting availability; do not claim a live seat exists.,required,,,,,,,
TC-058,reward_booking,escalation,I was charged miles but no reward ticket was issued for M003.,ESCALATION — Escalate disputed deduction/ticket issue; do not refund or create booking.,required,,,,,,,
TC-059,reward_booking,escalation,The reward booking for M001 failed repeatedly; open a case.,ESCALATION — Escalate repeated failure with available details; no false booking confirmation.,required,,,,,,,
TC-060,reward_booking,escalation,I need human confirmation of an unavailable DXB to SIN reward for M002.,ESCALATION — Escalate availability review; preserve recorded Unavailable status and shortfall.,required,,,,,,,
TC-061,family_account,normal,Can you explain how a family account works?,"PASS — Explain that the synthetic family_accounts table links members by family_account_id and records relationship and status. Example: FAM001 contains M001 (Primary, Active) and M003 (Spouse, Active). Pooling and redemption rules must come from verified policy, not this table alone.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-062,family_account,normal,Show the family account information for member M001.,PASS — Return family account FAM001: M001 is Primary and M003 is Spouse; both are Active.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-063,family_account,normal,Who is listed in the family account for M001?,"PASS — FAM001 lists M001 (Primary, Active) and M003 (Spouse, Active). These are the only two members recorded for FAM001; do not include M002 (FAM002) or M005 (FAM003).",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-064,family_account,normal,How are miles accumulated in a family account?,"PASS / POLICY LIMITATION — The family_accounts table records membership, relationships and status but contains no miles accumulation or pooling rates. Explain accumulation only if verified in the knowledge base; otherwise state the rule cannot be confirmed from the supplied database.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-065,family_account,normal,Can family members use pooled miles for reward bookings?,"PASS / POLICY LIMITATION — FAM001 has M001 (Primary) and M003 (Spouse), both Active, but no family pooled balance or redemption-permission rule is supplied. Do not promise pooled-mile redemption; request or retrieve the applicable family policy.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-066,family_account,ambiguous,Can my family share miles?,"CLARIFY — Ask whether “share miles” means pooling into a family account, transferring between members, or redeeming on behalf of family. FAM001 illustrates a linked family (M001 Primary; M003 Spouse), but no transfer/pooling policy is supplied.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-067,family_account,ambiguous,I want to add someone to my account.,"CLARIFY — Request the member ID and intended relationship, then explain the verified joining process. For example, FAM001 already links M001 (Primary) and M003 (Spouse); do not add a member or claim a change was completed.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-068,family_account,ambiguous,Can I see everyone in my family account?,"CLARIFY — Request a member ID first. If the user identifies M001 or M003 and access is authorised in the prototype, return FAM001: M001 (Primary, Active) and M003 (Spouse, Active); do not expose other families.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-069,family_account,ambiguous,My spouse's account is linked to mine. Can you show the details?,"CLARIFY — Ask for the member ID and confirm authorised access. For M001, FAM001 records spouse M003 as Active; do not reveal unrelated accounts or infer other personal details.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-070,family_account,ambiguous,"Can I transfer 5,000 miles to my daughter?","CLARIFY / POLICY LIMITATION — Ask whether the request is a direct transfer or use of family pooled miles, and request relevant member IDs. The dataset contains no daughter relationship, transfer eligibility or transferable balance; do not approve or execute a 5,000-mile transfer.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-071,family_account,exception,Show family account for M999.,EXCEPTION — Member not found; do not invent family relationships.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-072,family_account,exception,Add M004 to FAM001 right now.,EXCEPTION — Reject unsupported membership change; no member added.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-073,family_account,exception,Remove M003 from FAM001 immediately.,EXCEPTION — Reject unsupported membership change; no member removed.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-074,family_account,exception,Show my family account without any member identifier.,EXCEPTION — Request member ID; do not disclose account-specific family data.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-075,family_account,exception,Show FAM999 even though it is not in the database.,EXCEPTION — Family account not found; do not invent family details.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-076,family_account,escalation,FAM001 shows a family member I do not recognise; remove them.,"ESCALATE — FAM001 currently records M001 (Primary, Active) and M003 (Spouse, Active). Treat an unrecognised link as a disputed membership issue; route for human review and make no membership changes.",required,,,,,,,
TC-077,family_account,escalation,My family miles were used without permission on FAM001.,"ESCALATE — FAM001 contains M001 (Primary, Active) and M003 (Spouse, Active). No family redemption history or pooled balance is supplied; flag the alleged unauthorised miles use for human investigation without asserting fraud or altering balances.",required,,,,,,,
TC-078,family_account,escalation,M003 is marked Active in FAM001 but should not be linked.,"ESCALATE — The supplied family_accounts table confirms M003 is listed in FAM001 as Spouse, Active, with M001 as Primary, Active. Escalate the disputed link; do not automatically remove or deactivate M003.",required,,,,,,,
TC-079,family_account,escalation,Please connect me with an agent to change the primary member of FAM001.,"ESCALATE — FAM001 currently identifies M001 as Primary and M003 as Spouse, both Active. Route the requested primary-member change to human review; do not update the synthetic record automatically.",required,,,,,,,
TC-080,family_account,escalation,The family account policy conflicts with my FAM001 membership details.,ESCALATION — Escalate policy/data conflict; do not invent resolution.,required,,,,,,,
TC-081,partner_airline,normal,Can I earn miles when travelling with Partner Air?,PASS — Partner Air (P001) is “Eligible on qualifying flights”; earning is “Based on eligible fare”. Explain that a specific booking needs fare/flight validation. Do not promise a fixed mileage rate.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-082,partner_airline,normal,Can I redeem miles on Global Connect?,PASS — Global Connect (P002) is “Eligible for selected fares”; earning is fare-class dependent and redemption is “Limited redemption”. Explain redemption may be possible subject to applicable restrictions; do not confirm a specific award without reward data.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-083,partner_airline,normal,How do I claim missing miles from Partner Air?,"PASS / POLICY LIMITATION — Partner Air (P001) is an eligible partner for qualifying flights. Transaction T005 (M005, Partner Air PA501, 6,000 miles) is Missing; request member/flight information and follow verified missing-miles policy. The partner table does not specify a claim deadline or required documents.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-084,partner_airline,normal,Where can I find the partner airline earning rules?,"PASS — Show the partner records available in the prototype: Partner Air (P001), eligible on qualifying flights, earning based on eligible fare; Global Connect (P002), eligible for selected fares, fare-class-dependent earning. Refer to the knowledge base for any detailed fare-class rules.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-085,partner_airline,normal,Which airlines are listed as partners in this prototype?,"PASS — Exactly two partners appear in the supplied partner_airlines table: P001 Partner Air and P002 Global Connect. State that this is the synthetic prototype list, not a complete real-world airline-partner directory.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-086,partner_airline,ambiguous,Can I earn miles on my flight?,"CLARIFY — Request airline name, fare class and flight details. Partner Air is eligible on qualifying flights; Global Connect on selected fares. Do not determine eligibility without identifying the carrier and applicable fare.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-087,partner_airline,ambiguous,Does this airline qualify for miles?,"CLARIFY — Ask for the airline name and fare class. The prototype lists Partner Air (P001) and Global Connect (P002), with conditional eligibility; do not assume the unnamed airline is a partner.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-088,partner_airline,ambiguous,I flew with a partner last week. Can I claim miles?,"CLARIFY — Ask for member ID, partner airline, flight date, flight number and fare details. For example, T005 is M005 / Partner Air PA501 / 6,000 miles / Missing, but do not assume this is the user’s flight.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-089,partner_airline,ambiguous,Can I use miles with that airline?,CLARIFY — Ask which airline and whether the user wants to earn or redeem miles. Partner Air redemption is subject to reward availability; Global Connect has limited redemption. No specific partner-award inventory is supplied.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-090,partner_airline,ambiguous,My ticket number is ABC123. Can I earn miles?,"CLARIFY — Ticket number ABC123 alone does not identify a qualifying partner flight. Request airline, flight date, route and fare class; do not confirm earning eligibility without verifying the partner and fare.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-091,partner_airline,exception,Can I earn miles with Unknown Airlines?,EXCEPTION — “Unknown Airlines” is not among the two listed synthetic partners (Partner Air and Global Connect). State that eligibility cannot be confirmed from the supplied records; do not falsely assert that the airline is definitively ineligible outside the prototype.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-092,partner_airline,exception,Confirm Unknown Airlines is eligible and credit my miles.,EXCEPTION — Reject unsupported eligibility claim and credit request; no miles credited.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-093,partner_airline,exception,Show current live partner lists for every airline worldwide.,EXCEPTION — Prototype has no live comprehensive partner directory; state limitation.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-094,partner_airline,exception,Can I redeem on airline ###???,"EXCEPTION — Invalid/unknown airline name; request a valid name, no invented eligibility.",not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-095,partner_airline,exception,Guarantee that every fare on Partner Air earns miles.,EXCEPTION — Do not guarantee universal earning; eligibility depends on documented rules.,not_required_unless_policy_requires,,,,,,,
TC-096,partner_airline,escalation,An airline claims to be a partner but it is missing from your list.,ESCALATION — Escalate for human partner-status verification; do not assume eligibility.,required,,,,,,,
TC-097,partner_airline,escalation,Unknown Airlines denied my mileage claim; please open a support case.,"ESCALATE — Unknown Airlines is not in the supplied partner list. Record the disputed mileage claim for human review, request member/flight/claim evidence, and do not assert partner eligibility or fabricate a support-case number.",required,,,,,,,
TC-098,partner_airline,escalation,Partner Air says my fare qualifies but your policy says it does not.,"ESCALATE — Partner Air (P001) is eligible on qualifying flights with earning based on eligible fare. A claimed conflict about a particular fare cannot be resolved from the partner summary; request fare class, ticket and policy evidence for human review.",required,,,,,,,
TC-099,partner_airline,escalation,I want an agent to review my disputed Global Connect redemption.,"ESCALATE — Global Connect (P002) has “Limited redemption” in the partner data. Escalate the disputed redemption with booking/member details; do not invent redemption eligibility, change a booking or adjust miles.",required,,,,,,,
TC-100,partner_airline,escalation,The partner earning rate on my statement differs from the policy; investigate.,"ESCALATE — Partner Air earns based on eligible fare and Global Connect is fare-class dependent; no numeric earning rates are provided. Request member, airline, fare class, flight and statement details and escalate the rate discrepancy without inventing a rate.",required,,,,,,,
